<title>UK: Nordbanken sets $100 mln structured perpetual FRN.</title>
<headline>Nordbanken sets $100 mln structured perpetual FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated structured floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Credit Suisse First Boston and Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT	  $100 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +50 BP    PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.45</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB+	REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE AT PAR ON COUPON DATES FROM MARCH 2002</p>
<p>		AFTER WHICH MARGIN RISES TO 200 BP.</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  0.15</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
